{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_background }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
{%- liquid
  assign basket_blocks    = section.blocks | where: "type", "basket_step"
  assign flat_blocks      = section.blocks | where: "type", "flat_step"
  assign chamber_blocks   = section.blocks | where: "type", "chamber_step"
  assign cup_tool_blocks  = section.blocks | where: "type", "cup_tool_step"
  assign basket_total     = basket_blocks.size | plus: 2
  assign flat_total       = flat_blocks.size | plus: 1
-%}
<div class="wrap">
  <section class="ch" id="pack"><p class="ch__num">05 · Start</p><h2>Pack the cup</h2><p class="ch__lead">Two light layers of your usual tobacco. First choose the mesh: it changes the smoke, the pack and the heat.</p><div class="grams"><b>10–15 g</b><span>of your usual tobacco. <b>Mix it first:</b> the juice settles at the bottom of the tin.</span></div><h3>Touching or not: two meshes</h3><p class="h3lead">It is the same craft as packing a bowl for coal. The difference is whether the tobacco touches the hot cup.</p><div class="slider tslider slider--grid" style="--n:2"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Flat screen: in contact</b><p>The tobacco sits against the cup, like a bowl packed in contact under the coals: a deeper roast, a fuller, denser smoke, and it needs less heat. Fine, dry cuts open up best here, Tangiers for example. A little more work to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
    {%- if section.settings.flat_screen != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.flat_screen | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_screen.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div></figure><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">2</span><b>Basket mesh: off the walls</b><p>The basket holds the tobacco away from the cup: an airy, fluffy pack, a lighter smoke, and it needs more heat. Moist and strong blends feel much smoother. Lifts out in one piece to clean.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
    {%- if section.settings.basket_empty != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.basket_empty | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.basket_empty.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3>Pick your mesh, then pack</h3><div class="mpick"><button type="button" class="mpick__c on" data-mesh="basket" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="pack-basket">
    {%- if section.settings.img_basket != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.img_basket | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_basket.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
    <b>Basket mesh</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Lighter and airy</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Loose and fluffy, pressed just a little</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs more: set the dial higher</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>Easy: lifts out in one piece</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane on" id="pack-basket"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ basket_total }}"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Basket in the cup</b><p>Set the basket mesh in the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
    {%- if section.settings.basket_empty != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.basket_empty | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.basket_empty.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div></figure>
    {%- for block in basket_blocks -%}
      <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index | plus: 1 }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
        {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
          {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div></figure>
    {%- endfor -%}
    <figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ basket_total }}</span><b>To the edge</b><p>Stop at the edge of the mesh. Then set the dial a little higher.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
    <picture><source media="(max-width:749px)" srcset="{{ 'pack-level-basket-m.webp' | file_url }}"><img src="{{ 'pack-level-basket.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Basket mesh filled to the edge of the basket" loading="lazy"></picture>
  </div></figure></div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div><button type="button" class="mpick__c" data-mesh="flat" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="pack-flat">
    {%- if section.settings.img_screens != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.img_screens | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.img_screens.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
    <b>Flat screen</b><dl><div><dt>Smoke</dt><dd>Fuller and denser</dd></div><div><dt>Pack</dt><dd>Even layers, pressed lightly</dd></div><div><dt>Heat</dt><dd>Needs less: more contact with the cup</dd></div><div><dt>Cleaning</dt><dd>More work: brush the screen and the cup</dd></div></dl><span class="mpick__open">How to pack it</span></button><div class="mpane" id="pack-flat"><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ flat_total }}"><div class="slides"><figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">1</span><b>Screen on the bottom</b><p>Lay the flat screen on the bottom of the cup.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
    {%- if section.settings.flat_screen != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.flat_screen | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.flat_screen.alt | default: '' -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div></figure>
    {%- for block in flat_blocks -%}
      <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index | plus: 1 }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
        {%- if forloop.last -%}
          <picture><source media="(max-width:749px)" srcset="{{ 'pack-level-m.webp' | file_url }}"><img src="{{ 'pack-level.webp' | file_url }}" alt="Flat screen cup filled to the curve of the cup" loading="lazy"></picture>
        {%- elsif block.settings.image != blank -%}
          {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div></figure>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div></div></div><h3>Mix in layers</h3><div class="pk-heatmap">
      {%- render 'mix-layers-schema' -%}
      <div><p class="pk-lead" style="margin:0">Diamond heats the cup from the sides and from below at the same time; the tobacco at the bottom gets it most. So the bottom layer is your main flavor and opens first, and the top layer is the accent that comes through as the cup warms. Two flavors are plenty.</p></div>
    </div><h3>By tobacco</h3><div class="pk-cards">
      <article>
        {%- if section.settings.cup_filled != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.cup_filled | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'pk-cardimg', alt: section.settings.cup_filled.alt | default: 'A cup packed with blonde leaf tobacco' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg class="pk-cardimg" viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h3>Virginia, blonde leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Starline, Fumari, Adalya</p><p>Pre-heat 7 minutes at about 255 °C (491 °F), then turn it down as the session goes.</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Very minty or perfumed blends: less heat, around 235 °C (455 °F), and let the cup open up over time.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        {%- if section.settings.dark_leaf_packed != blank -%}
          {{- section.settings.dark_leaf_packed | image_url: width: 600 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'pk-cardimg', alt: section.settings.dark_leaf_packed.alt | default: 'A cup packed with dark leaf tobacco' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg class="pk-cardimg" viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h3>Burley, dark leaf</h3><p class="pk-eg">Darkside, MustHave, BlackBurn</p><p>Pack it airy in the basket mesh. Pre-heat 7 minutes, like every blend; the strongest like it at up to 290 °C (554 °F).</p>
        <p class="pk-tip">Try Oracle, the fourth profile.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  {%- if chamber_blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <h3>Into the chamber</h3><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ chamber_blocks.size }}"><div class="slides">
      {%- for block in chamber_blocks -%}
        <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
          {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
            {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
          {%- else -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div></figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <h3 id="cup-tool">Out, swap, clean: the cup tool</h3><p class="h3lead">The fork only takes the cup out: to clean, to change the cup mid-session, when the taste fades or the tobacco is spent. Its other end turns the plate on the cap, see <a href="#the-cap">The cap and the draw</a>.</p>
  {%- if cup_tool_blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ cup_tool_blocks.size }}"><div class="slides">
      {%- for block in cup_tool_blocks -%}
        <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
          {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
            {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
          {%- else -%}
            <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div></figure>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div>
  {%- endif -%}
  <p class="more"><a href="/pages/diamond-packing-guide">The packing guide: tobaccos, mixes and heat ›</a></p></section>
</div>

